        <details key="documentation" value="An enumeration value that determines the type of result set that is returned from the Execute method. This property can have one of the following values:Tabular - Returns a result set using the Rowset data type. See section 2.2.4.1.3 for the definition of the Rowset type.Multidimensional - Returns a rowset using the mddataset data type. See section 2.2.4.1.1 for the definition of the mddataset type.Native - No format is explicitly specified."/>
      </eAnnotations>
