  <eClassifiers xsi:type="ecore:EClass" name="UpdateCells" eSuperTypes="#//Command">
    <eAnnotations source="http://www.eclipse.org/emf/2002/GenModel">
      <details key="documentation" value="The UpdateCells command updates the values of the specified cells. &lt;xsd:complexType name=&quot;UpdateCells&quot;> &lt;xsd:sequence> &lt;xsd:element name=&quot;Cell&quot; type=&quot;Cell&quot; minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; maxOccurs=&quot;unbounded&quot;/> &lt;/xsd:sequence> &lt;/xsd:complexType> The UpdateCells command is stateful and therefore is used in conjunction with SOAP header elements. When the client has defined an mddataset result that the client requests to update by using the UpdateCells command, the client MUST tell the server to keep the result available for updating. However, a KeepResult element is added to the SOAP header. …"/>
    </eAnnotations>
